observe(PlacementReview, Placement_Case_Zeno, NoSuitableConsentingHomeAvailableAndOrdinarySupportedResidenceSecured, CustodyPlacementAlternativeScope).
authorized(CustodyIntake, CustodyIntakeAuthority, Case_Zeno).
authorized(CustodyIntakeAudit, IndependentCustodyIntakeAuditor, Case_Zeno).
